<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιτ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
		ʽκοίτη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>abed</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. γίγνεσθαι ἐν τῇ χώρᾳ</span> to
				<i>pass the night</i> in the country, Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.37
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάξας ἡμέραν ἐν ᾗ δεήσει
				πάντας ἐν Ἀριμίνῳ γενέσθαι κ.</span>
			<i>encamp</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.61.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἔρχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					177
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸκ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοίτη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i>lair</i> of a wild beast, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>TG</u>
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰκ. ἐπισπένδειν</span> take a <i>last
				cup, 'night-cap</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				3.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
